			"ChannelTitle": "Kanishk Nishar",
			"Description": "Sibelius Festival 2012 concerts free at http://www.classiclive.com/Concerts\n\nLahti Symphony Orchestra\n\nSibelius Festival 2012 Day 2\n\nOkko Kamu, conductor\n\nJean Sibelius: Press Celebrations Music, JS 137\n\nPreludio\nTableau 1: V\u00E4in\u00E4m\u00F6inen delights Nature, and the peoples of Kaleva and\nPohjola, with his song\nTableau 2: The Finns are baptized\nTableau 3: Scene from Duke Johan\u0027s Court\nTableau 4: The Finns in the Thirty Years War\nTableau 5: The Great Hostility\nTableau 6: Finland Awakes\n\nThe Lahti Symphony Orchestra\u00B4s Sibelius Festival, under the baton of Okko Kamu, the orchestra\u00B4s principal conductor and the festival\u00B4s artistic director, took place on 6th-9th September 2012. The festival\u00B4s theme was \u00B4Sibelius - patriot and mystic\u0060. \n\nRecorded at Lahti Sibelius Hall Finland, 7th September 2012\n\nhttp://www.sinfonialahti.fi/\nhttp://www.facebook.com/lahtisymphony\nhttps://twitter.com/lahtisymphony\nhttp://www.classiclive.com/",
